## 9. User Roles & Permissions

LearnStudio 2.0 implements role-based access control (RBAC) with three core roles:

1.  **ADMIN:** Full administrative access. Can seed data, manage all users, review platform analytics, delete courses/notes, and configure system-wide parameters.
2.  **INSTRUCTOR:** Academic content creators. Can manage batches, mark student attendance, upload course materials (notes/PDFs), create homework assignments, view batch analytics, and configure class timetables.
3.  **STUDENT:** Core learning consumers. Can browse and enroll in courses, view lessons, complete progress trackers, upload homework submissions, consult the AI doubt-solver, generate practice quizzes, and download earned certificates.

